commons bynk.par {
	---
	Options for the concurrent `List` forms `parForEachWith`, `parTraverseWith`,
	`parTraverseAllWith` and `parTraverseTryWith`. `limit` is how many steps may be
	in flight at once, a whole number from 1 to 1000; there is no default, so a
	call that passes no options starts every step at once, as before.
	---
	type ParOptions = {
		limit: Int,
	}
}
